{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"d4a6acce6539abdd62817410cb80db2f335abb129d934316c4953ab7e1f17951"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:33787d14ed603e7ae153d5d67478d6b7441cd50a320ebdbb846c4caf2abcbed5","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Frustrated but hopeful","evidence":"[D7:8 | 11:27 am on 2 June, 2023] Andrew: I'm still on the hunt, but it's tough finding a pet-friendly spot in the city. Been checking out some places, but no luck so far. A bit discouraged but I'm determined to find the right place and dog.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0b2ff5c6-de30-5af4-9bba-9c5c10d80406","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c4b2c0b0be4bac840c7e1eee0fb6a0681dedffded27a7869cae01ebaad4af919","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How does Andrew feel about their search for a pet-friendly place?","referenceAnswer":"Discouraged but determined","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c4b2c0b0be4bac840c7e1eee0fb6a0681dedffded27a7869cae01ebaad4af919"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}